 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The Passover was over and the caravans went home",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mary thought he walked with cousins, Joseph thought he'd gone on",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A day out on the road they searched among the friends",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he was nowhere to be found when the day came to its end",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "After three days they found him in the temple",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sitting among the teachers",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Listening to them and asking them questions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who heard him was astounded",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why were you searching for me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Did you not know that I must be in my Father's house",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why were you searching for me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I must be in my Father's house",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Child, why have you done this to us, his mother said in tears",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your father and I have been searching for you in anguish",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He went down with them to Nazareth and continued to obey them",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his mother treasured all these things in her heart",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
